* {{dlc+|anr}} The Lost starts with [[flight]], [[spectral tears]], {{i|D4}} (If unlocked), and the effect of {{i|Holy Mantle}} (after donating 879 coins to the {{e|Greed Donation Machine}}) {{dlc-}}
