'''Bethany''' is a [[character]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''. She is unlocked by defeating {{e|Mom's Heart}} or {{e|It Lives!}} in [[hard mode]] with {{c|Lazarus}} without [[death|losing a life]].

Bethany starts with three [[Red Heart container]]s, four soul charges (2{{e|Soul Heart}}s), and {{i|Book of Virtues}}.

Bethany is unable to utilize {{e|Soul Heart}}s and {{e|Black Heart}}s as health. When picked up, they instead are converted to a resource unique to Bethany called "soul charges" at the rate of one charge per half heart. The number of soul charges currently owned is listed along with the pickup counters. Soul charges can be consumed to use Bethany's activated item when the item isn't fully charged, at the rate of one soul charge per empty bar of charge.
